solidground console_preface.sh|24|6|SolidGround Management Console|||normal|||L1Sectionbody|The SolidGround Management Console is the interactive administration shell for|solidground console_preface.sh:::SolidGround Management Console:
solidground console_preface.sh|25|7|SolidGround Management Console|||normal|||L1Sectionbody|SolidGroundUX. It is built from a generic console host, a reusable menu engine,|solidground console_preface.sh:::SolidGround Management Console:
solidground console_preface.sh|26|8|SolidGround Management Console|||normal|||L1Sectionbody|and source-only functional modules.|solidground console_preface.sh:::SolidGround Management Console:
solidground console_preface.sh|27|9|SolidGround Management Console|||normal|||L1Sectionbody||solidground console_preface.sh:::SolidGround Management Console:
solidground console_preface.sh|28|10|SolidGround Management Console|||normal|||L1Sectionbody|The console deliberately separates discovery from loading. At startup it discovers|solidground console_preface.sh:::SolidGround Management Console:
solidground console_preface.sh|29|11|SolidGround Management Console|||normal|||L1Sectionbody|the available module files and reads only the literal module name and description|solidground console_preface.sh:::SolidGround Management Console:
solidground console_preface.sh|30|12|SolidGround Management Console|||normal|||L1Sectionbody|required to build the main index. The module body is not sourced until its page is|solidground console_preface.sh:::SolidGround Management Console:
solidground console_preface.sh|31|13|SolidGround Management Console|||normal|||L1Sectionbody|selected.|solidground console_preface.sh:::SolidGround Management Console:
solidground console_preface.sh|32|14|SolidGround Management Console|||normal|||L1Sectionbody||solidground console_preface.sh:::SolidGround Management Console:
solidground console_preface.sh|33|15|SolidGround Management Console|||normal|||L1Sectionbody|Once a module has been opened it remains loaded for the lifetime of the console|solidground console_preface.sh:::SolidGround Management Console:
solidground console_preface.sh|34|16|SolidGround Management Console|||normal|||L1Sectionbody|process. Returning to the index does not unload it, and opening the page again does|solidground console_preface.sh:::SolidGround Management Console:
solidground console_preface.sh|35|17|SolidGround Management Console|||normal|||L1Sectionbody|not source it a second time.|solidground console_preface.sh:::SolidGround Management Console:
solidground console_preface.sh|36|18|SolidGround Management Console|||normal|||L1Sectionbody||solidground console_preface.sh:::SolidGround Management Console:
