doc-generator.sh|36|23||||normal|||modulebody|  - Rendering output without the renderer component|doc-generator.sh::::
doc-generator.sh|37|24||||normal|||modulebody|  - Parsing arbitrary free-form comments outside framework conventions|doc-generator.sh::::
doc-generator.sh|38|25||||normal|||modulebody|  - Replacing the lower-level parser libraries|doc-generator.sh::::
