ui-ask.sh|2|1||||normal|||moduleheader|SolidGroundUX - UI Ask|ui-ask.sh::::
ui-ask.sh|13|2||||label|||modulebody|Description|ui-ask.sh::::
ui-ask.sh|14|3||||normal|||modulebody|  Provides the framework's console interaction layer.|ui-ask.sh::::
ui-ask.sh|15|4||||normal|||modulebody||ui-ask.sh::::
ui-ask.sh|16|5||||label|||modulebody|The library|ui-ask.sh::::
ui-ask.sh|17|6||||normal|||modulebody|    - Prompts for typed input using labeled questions|ui-ask.sh::::
ui-ask.sh|18|7||||normal|||modulebody|    - Supports editable defaults and validation hooks|ui-ask.sh::::
ui-ask.sh|19|8||||normal|||modulebody|    - Supports constrained symbolic decisions|ui-ask.sh::::
ui-ask.sh|20|9||||normal|||modulebody|    - Supports timed auto-continue prompts with simple intervention keys|ui-ask.sh::::
ui-ask.sh|21|10||||normal|||modulebody|    - Supports typed and immediate choice selection helpers|ui-ask.sh::::
ui-ask.sh|22|11||||normal|||modulebody|    - Supports normalized absolute and relative datetime input through ask_datetime|ui-ask.sh::::
ui-ask.sh|23|12||||normal|||modulebody|    - Supports prompting a variable set from field-spec lines|ui-ask.sh::::
ui-ask.sh|24|13||||normal|||modulebody|    - Reads input from the controlling terminal to avoid stdin conflicts|ui-ask.sh::::
ui-ask.sh|25|14||||normal|||modulebody||ui-ask.sh::::
