ui.sh|2|1||||normal|||moduleheader|SolidGroundUX - UI Rendering|ui.sh::::
ui.sh|13|2||||label|||modulebody|Description|ui.sh::::
ui.sh|14|3||||normal|||modulebody|  Provides the core rendering layer for styled terminal output within|ui.sh::::
ui.sh|15|4||||normal|||modulebody|  the SolidGroundUX framework.|ui.sh::::
ui.sh|16|5||||normal|||modulebody||ui.sh::::
ui.sh|17|6||||label|||modulebody|The library|ui.sh::::
ui.sh|18|7||||normal|||modulebody|    - Defines reusable rendering helpers for text and layout|ui.sh::::
ui.sh|19|8||||normal|||modulebody|    - Applies ANSI colors and text attributes through centralized helpers|ui.sh::::
ui.sh|20|9||||normal|||modulebody|    - Renders labeled values, section headers, title bars, and filled lines|ui.sh::::
ui.sh|21|10||||normal|||modulebody|    - Supports width-aware formatting for terminal output|ui.sh::::
ui.sh|22|11||||normal|||modulebody|    - Provides standardized message and presentation conventions|ui.sh::::
ui.sh|23|12||||normal|||modulebody||ui.sh::::
ui.sh|24|13||||label|||modulebody|Design principles|ui.sh::::
ui.sh|25|14||||normal|||modulebody|  - Centralized styling without inline ANSI codes in consuming modules|ui.sh::::
ui.sh|26|15||||normal|||modulebody|  - Readability over visual complexity|ui.sh::::
ui.sh|27|16||||normal|||modulebody|  - Graceful degradation when styling is disabled or unavailable|ui.sh::::
ui.sh|28|17||||normal|||modulebody|  - Consistent rendering semantics across all console tools|ui.sh::::
ui.sh|29|18||||normal|||modulebody||ui.sh::::
ui.sh|30|19||||label|||modulebody|Role in framework|ui.sh::::
ui.sh|31|20||||normal|||modulebody|  - Core visual layer for console-based SolidGroundUX tooling|ui.sh::::
ui.sh|32|21||||normal|||modulebody|  - Supports higher-level interaction modules such as ui-ask and sgnd-console|ui.sh::::
ui.sh|33|22||||normal|||modulebody||ui.sh::::
ui.sh|34|23||||label|||modulebody|Non-goals|ui.sh::::
ui.sh|35|24||||normal|||modulebody|  - Input handling or dialog flow control|ui.sh::::
ui.sh|36|25||||normal|||modulebody|  - Full terminal capability abstraction beyond framework needs|ui.sh::::
ui.sh|37|26||||normal|||modulebody|  - Graphical or window-based user interface functionality|ui.sh::::
ui.sh|38|27||||normal|||modulebody||ui.sh::::
