sgnd-core.sh|2|1||||normal|||moduleheader|SolidGroundUX - Core Utilities|sgnd-core.sh::::
sgnd-core.sh|13|2||||label|||modulebody|Description|sgnd-core.sh::::
sgnd-core.sh|14|3||||normal|||modulebody|  Contains the lowest-level generic helpers used throughout the SolidGroundUX|sgnd-core.sh::::
sgnd-core.sh|15|4||||normal|||modulebody|  framework.|sgnd-core.sh::::
sgnd-core.sh|16|5||||normal|||modulebody||sgnd-core.sh::::
sgnd-core.sh|17|6||||label|||modulebody|The library|sgnd-core.sh::::
sgnd-core.sh|18|7||||normal|||modulebody|    - Defines generic reusable helper functions|sgnd-core.sh::::
sgnd-core.sh|19|8||||normal|||modulebody|    - Provides string, array, and low-level utility primitives|sgnd-core.sh::::
sgnd-core.sh|20|9||||normal|||modulebody|    - Implements shared conventions and diagnostics helpers|sgnd-core.sh::::
sgnd-core.sh|21|10||||normal|||modulebody|    - Avoids system-, UI-, and business-specific behavior where possible|sgnd-core.sh::::
sgnd-core.sh|22|11||||normal|||modulebody||sgnd-core.sh::::
sgnd-core.sh|23|12||||label|||modulebody|Design principles|sgnd-core.sh::::
sgnd-core.sh|24|13||||normal|||modulebody|  - Keep utilities generic and broadly reusable|sgnd-core.sh::::
sgnd-core.sh|25|14||||normal|||modulebody|  - Avoid domain-specific logic in core helpers|sgnd-core.sh::::
sgnd-core.sh|26|15||||normal|||modulebody|  - Prefer clarity and predictability over cleverness|sgnd-core.sh::::
