doc-renderer.sh|2|1||||normal|||moduleheader|SolidGroundUX - Documentation Renderer|doc-renderer.sh::::
doc-renderer.sh|14|2||||label|||modulebody|Description|doc-renderer.sh::::
doc-renderer.sh|15|3||||normal|||modulebody|  Converts parser-owned documentation tables into renderer input files and delegates|doc-renderer.sh::::
doc-renderer.sh|16|4||||normal|||modulebody|  final HTML generation to the Python documentation renderer.|doc-renderer.sh::::
doc-renderer.sh|17|5||||normal|||modulebody||doc-renderer.sh::::
doc-renderer.sh|18|6||||label|||modulebody|Design principles|doc-renderer.sh::::
doc-renderer.sh|19|7||||normal|||modulebody|  - Keep parsing, export preparation, and final rendering separate.|doc-renderer.sh::::
doc-renderer.sh|20|8||||normal|||modulebody|  - Use explicit table-shaped arrays and PSV files as intermediate models.|doc-renderer.sh::::
