bootstrap_preface.sh|59|41|Bootstrap Environment|Bootstrap||normal|||L2Sectionbody|  |bootstrap_preface.sh::Bootstrap:Bootstrap Environment:
bootstrap_preface.sh|60|42|Bootstrap Environment|Bootstrap||normal|||L2Sectionbody|By resolving these paths centrally, scripts do not need to hard-code installation|bootstrap_preface.sh::Bootstrap:Bootstrap Environment:
