bootstrap_preface.sh|67|49|Automatic Library Loading|Bootstrap||normal|||L2Sectionbody|SolidGroundUX uses a dependency declaration mechanism to determine which|bootstrap_preface.sh::Bootstrap:Automatic Library Loading:
bootstrap_preface.sh|68|50|Automatic Library Loading|Bootstrap||normal|||L2Sectionbody|libraries should be available to a script.|bootstrap_preface.sh::Bootstrap:Automatic Library Loading:
bootstrap_preface.sh|69|51|Automatic Library Loading|Bootstrap||normal|||L2Sectionbody|  |bootstrap_preface.sh::Bootstrap:Automatic Library Loading:
bootstrap_preface.sh|70|52|Automatic Library Loading|Bootstrap||normal|||L2Sectionbody|Scripts can populate `SGND_USING` to declare framework libraries they depend on.|bootstrap_preface.sh::Bootstrap:Automatic Library Loading:
bootstrap_preface.sh|71|53|Automatic Library Loading|Bootstrap||normal|||L2Sectionbody|During bootstrap, the framework resolves these entries and sources the required|bootstrap_preface.sh::Bootstrap:Automatic Library Loading:
bootstrap_preface.sh|72|54|Automatic Library Loading|Bootstrap||normal|||L2Sectionbody|files automatically.|bootstrap_preface.sh::Bootstrap:Automatic Library Loading:
bootstrap_preface.sh|73|55|Automatic Library Loading|Bootstrap||normal|||L2Sectionbody|  |bootstrap_preface.sh::Bootstrap:Automatic Library Loading:
bootstrap_preface.sh|74|56|Automatic Library Loading|Bootstrap||normal|||L2Sectionbody|This keeps executable scripts smaller and makes dependencies explicit near the|bootstrap_preface.sh::Bootstrap:Automatic Library Loading:
bootstrap_preface.sh|75|57|Automatic Library Loading|Bootstrap||normal|||L2Sectionbody|top of the file. Instead of scattering `source` statements throughout the script,|bootstrap_preface.sh::Bootstrap:Automatic Library Loading:
bootstrap_preface.sh|76|58|Automatic Library Loading|Bootstrap||normal|||L2Sectionbody|the script declares what it needs and lets the bootstrap layer perform the actual|bootstrap_preface.sh::Bootstrap:Automatic Library Loading:
bootstrap_preface.sh|77|59|Automatic Library Loading|Bootstrap||normal|||L2Sectionbody|loading.|bootstrap_preface.sh::Bootstrap:Automatic Library Loading:
bootstrap_preface.sh|78|60|Automatic Library Loading|Bootstrap||normal|||L2Sectionbody|  |bootstrap_preface.sh::Bootstrap:Automatic Library Loading:
bootstrap_preface.sh|79|61|Automatic Library Loading|Bootstrap||normal|||L2Sectionbody|Core libraries needed by bootstrap are loaded automatically. Project definitions are|bootstrap_preface.sh::Bootstrap:Automatic Library Loading:
bootstrap_preface.sh|80|62|Automatic Library Loading|Bootstrap||normal|||L2Sectionbody|sourced explicitly as foundational globals rather than through `SGND_USING`; additional|bootstrap_preface.sh::Bootstrap:Automatic Library Loading:
bootstrap_preface.sh|81|63|Automatic Library Loading|Bootstrap||normal|||L2Sectionbody|libraries are then loaded from the script's declared requirements.|bootstrap_preface.sh::Bootstrap:Automatic Library Loading:
