bootstrap_preface.sh|102|84|Configuration Management|Bootstrap||normal|||L2Sectionbody|Configuration handling is integrated into the bootstrap lifecycle.|bootstrap_preface.sh::Bootstrap:Configuration Management:
bootstrap_preface.sh|103|85|Configuration Management|Bootstrap||normal|||L2Sectionbody|  |bootstrap_preface.sh::Bootstrap:Configuration Management:
bootstrap_preface.sh|104|86|Configuration Management|Bootstrap||normal|||L2Sectionbody|When configuration-related globals are available, the framework can initialize|bootstrap_preface.sh::Bootstrap:Configuration Management:
bootstrap_preface.sh|105|87|Configuration Management|Bootstrap||normal|||L2Sectionbody|configuration metadata, determine expected configuration files, load values, and|bootstrap_preface.sh::Bootstrap:Configuration Management:
bootstrap_preface.sh|106|88|Configuration Management|Bootstrap||normal|||L2Sectionbody|apply them before the main application logic runs.|bootstrap_preface.sh::Bootstrap:Configuration Management:
bootstrap_preface.sh|107|89|Configuration Management|Bootstrap||normal|||L2Sectionbody|  |bootstrap_preface.sh::Bootstrap:Configuration Management:
bootstrap_preface.sh|108|90|Configuration Management|Bootstrap||normal|||L2Sectionbody|This means a script can define the values it cares about, while the framework|bootstrap_preface.sh::Bootstrap:Configuration Management:
bootstrap_preface.sh|109|91|Configuration Management|Bootstrap||normal|||L2Sectionbody|handles the repetitive work of loading, overriding, and exposing those values.|bootstrap_preface.sh::Bootstrap:Configuration Management:
bootstrap_preface.sh|110|92|Configuration Management|Bootstrap||normal|||L2Sectionbody|  |bootstrap_preface.sh::Bootstrap:Configuration Management:
bootstrap_preface.sh|111|93|Configuration Management|Bootstrap||normal|||L2Sectionbody|The result is a consistent configuration model across scripts without requiring|bootstrap_preface.sh::Bootstrap:Configuration Management:
bootstrap_preface.sh|112|94|Configuration Management|Bootstrap||normal|||L2Sectionbody|every executable to implement its own configuration parser.|bootstrap_preface.sh::Bootstrap:Configuration Management:
