ui_preface.sh|51|33|UI Architecture|User Interface||normal|||L2Sectionbody|The lower layers do not depend on application-specific behavior. Higher layers|ui_preface.sh::User Interface:UI Architecture:
ui_preface.sh|52|34|UI Architecture|User Interface||normal|||L2Sectionbody|build on the rendering and input primitives below them. This keeps formatting,|ui_preface.sh::User Interface:UI Architecture:
