ui_preface.sh|81|63|Themes, Palettes, and Run Modes|User Interface||normal|||L2Sectionheader|Themes, Palettes, and Run Modes|ui_preface.sh::User Interface:Themes, Palettes, and Run Modes:
ui_preface.sh|82|64|Themes, Palettes, and Run Modes|User Interface||normal|||L2Sectionbody||ui_preface.sh::User Interface:Themes, Palettes, and Run Modes:
ui_preface.sh|83|65|Themes, Palettes, and Run Modes|User Interface||normal|||L2Sectionbody|Styling is resolved centrally. Palettes define named colors and visual roles,|ui_preface.sh::User Interface:Themes, Palettes, and Run Modes:
ui_preface.sh|84|66|Themes, Palettes, and Run Modes|User Interface||normal|||L2Sectionbody|while themes determine how those roles are applied by the rendering functions.|ui_preface.sh::User Interface:Themes, Palettes, and Run Modes:
ui_preface.sh|85|67|Themes, Palettes, and Run Modes|User Interface||normal|||L2Sectionbody|This prevents consuming scripts from embedding ANSI codes or hard-coded color|ui_preface.sh::User Interface:Themes, Palettes, and Run Modes:
ui_preface.sh|86|68|Themes, Palettes, and Run Modes|User Interface||normal|||L2Sectionbody|choices.|ui_preface.sh::User Interface:Themes, Palettes, and Run Modes:
ui_preface.sh|87|69|Themes, Palettes, and Run Modes|User Interface||normal|||L2Sectionbody||ui_preface.sh::User Interface:Themes, Palettes, and Run Modes:
ui_preface.sh|88|70|Themes, Palettes, and Run Modes|User Interface||normal|||L2Sectionbody|The active style can reflect the current run mode, such as normal operation,|ui_preface.sh::User Interface:Themes, Palettes, and Run Modes:
ui_preface.sh|89|71|Themes, Palettes, and Run Modes|User Interface||normal|||L2Sectionbody|dry-run execution, debugging, or another framework-defined state. Applications|ui_preface.sh::User Interface:Themes, Palettes, and Run Modes:
ui_preface.sh|90|72|Themes, Palettes, and Run Modes|User Interface||normal|||L2Sectionbody|communicate intent through the public API; the UI layer selects the appropriate|ui_preface.sh::User Interface:Themes, Palettes, and Run Modes:
