ui_preface.sh|93|75|Themes, Palettes, and Run Modes|User Interface||normal|||L2Sectionbody|When styling is disabled or unsupported, UI functions should degrade to readable|ui_preface.sh::User Interface:Themes, Palettes, and Run Modes:
ui_preface.sh|94|76|Themes, Palettes, and Run Modes|User Interface||normal|||L2Sectionbody|plain text without changing the semantic content of the output.|ui_preface.sh::User Interface:Themes, Palettes, and Run Modes:
