sgnd-cfg.sh|2|1||||normal|||moduleheader|SolidGroundUX - Configuration Management|sgnd-cfg.sh::::
sgnd-cfg.sh|13|2||||label|||modulebody|Description|sgnd-cfg.sh::::
sgnd-cfg.sh|14|3||||normal|||modulebody|  Provides configuration handling for the SolidGroundUX framework.|sgnd-cfg.sh::::
sgnd-cfg.sh|15|4||||normal|||modulebody||sgnd-cfg.sh::::
sgnd-cfg.sh|16|5||||label|||modulebody|The library|sgnd-cfg.sh::::
sgnd-cfg.sh|17|6||||normal|||modulebody|    - Loads configuration from system and user locations|sgnd-cfg.sh::::
sgnd-cfg.sh|18|7||||normal|||modulebody|    - Resolves effective configuration using precedence rules|sgnd-cfg.sh::::
sgnd-cfg.sh|19|8||||normal|||modulebody|    - Supports reading and writing key-value configuration files|sgnd-cfg.sh::::
sgnd-cfg.sh|20|9||||normal|||modulebody|    - Ensures required configuration values are present|sgnd-cfg.sh::::
sgnd-cfg.sh|21|10||||normal|||modulebody|    - Provides helper functions for accessing configuration values|sgnd-cfg.sh::::
sgnd-cfg.sh|22|11||||normal|||modulebody|    - Integrates with bootstrap and runtime state handling|sgnd-cfg.sh::::
sgnd-cfg.sh|23|12||||normal|||modulebody||sgnd-cfg.sh::::
sgnd-cfg.sh|24|13||||label|||modulebody|Design principles|sgnd-cfg.sh::::
sgnd-cfg.sh|25|14||||normal|||modulebody|  - Clear separation between system-level and user-level configuration|sgnd-cfg.sh::::
sgnd-cfg.sh|26|15||||normal|||modulebody|  - Deterministic resolution of configuration values|sgnd-cfg.sh::::
sgnd-cfg.sh|27|16||||normal|||modulebody|  - Minimal and transparent configuration format|sgnd-cfg.sh::::
sgnd-cfg.sh|28|17||||normal|||modulebody|  - Safe defaults with optional overrides|sgnd-cfg.sh::::
sgnd-cfg.sh|29|18||||normal|||modulebody||sgnd-cfg.sh::::
sgnd-cfg.sh|30|19||||label|||modulebody|Role in framework|sgnd-cfg.sh::::
sgnd-cfg.sh|31|20||||normal|||modulebody|  - Central configuration layer used during bootstrap and runtime|sgnd-cfg.sh::::
sgnd-cfg.sh|32|21||||normal|||modulebody|  - Supplies paths, settings, and environment-specific values|sgnd-cfg.sh::::
sgnd-cfg.sh|33|22||||normal|||modulebody|  - Supports scripts and modules requiring persistent configuration|sgnd-cfg.sh::::
sgnd-cfg.sh|34|23||||normal|||modulebody||sgnd-cfg.sh::::
sgnd-cfg.sh|35|24||||label|||modulebody|Non-goals|sgnd-cfg.sh::::
sgnd-cfg.sh|36|25||||normal|||modulebody|  - Complex hierarchical configuration systems|sgnd-cfg.sh::::
sgnd-cfg.sh|37|26||||normal|||modulebody|  - External configuration formats (JSON, YAML, etc.)|sgnd-cfg.sh::::
sgnd-cfg.sh|38|27||||normal|||modulebody|  - Runtime hot-reloading of configuration|sgnd-cfg.sh::::
sgnd-cfg.sh|39|28||||normal|||modulebody||sgnd-cfg.sh::::
