sgnd-cfg.sh|52|33|Library guard|||normal|_sgnd_lib_guard|Enforce source-only, single-load library initialization|functionbody||sgnd-cfg.sh:::Library guard:_sgnd_lib_guard
sgnd-cfg.sh|53|34|Library guard|||highlight|_sgnd_lib_guard|Enforce source-only, single-load library initialization|functionbody|Behavior|sgnd-cfg.sh:::Library guard:_sgnd_lib_guard
sgnd-cfg.sh|54|35|Library guard|||normal|_sgnd_lib_guard|Enforce source-only, single-load library initialization|functionbody|  - Derives a unique guard variable name from the current filename.|sgnd-cfg.sh:::Library guard:_sgnd_lib_guard
