sgnd-exe-common.sh|2|1||||normal|||moduleheader|SolidGroundUX - Executable Runtime Support|sgnd-exe-common.sh::::
sgnd-exe-common.sh|13|2||||label|||modulebody|Description|sgnd-exe-common.sh::::
sgnd-exe-common.sh|14|3||||normal|||modulebody|  Provides executable-level runtime support used after the framework has been|sgnd-exe-common.sh::::
sgnd-exe-common.sh|15|4||||normal|||modulebody|  located but before the full SolidGroundUX runtime has been bootstrapped.|sgnd-exe-common.sh::::
sgnd-exe-common.sh|16|5||||normal|||modulebody||sgnd-exe-common.sh::::
sgnd-exe-common.sh|17|6||||label|||modulebody|The library|sgnd-exe-common.sh::::
sgnd-exe-common.sh|18|7||||normal|||modulebody|    - Provides minimal pre-bootstrap UI output helpers|sgnd-exe-common.sh::::
sgnd-exe-common.sh|19|8||||normal|||modulebody|    - Resolves and loads the framework bootstrap library|sgnd-exe-common.sh::::
sgnd-exe-common.sh|20|9||||normal|||modulebody|    - Provides the standard executable startup sequence through sgnd_exe_start|sgnd-exe-common.sh::::
sgnd-exe-common.sh|21|10||||normal|||modulebody|    - Keeps executable templates small and consistent|sgnd-exe-common.sh::::
sgnd-exe-common.sh|22|11||||normal|||modulebody||sgnd-exe-common.sh::::
sgnd-exe-common.sh|23|12||||label|||modulebody|Design principles|sgnd-exe-common.sh::::
sgnd-exe-common.sh|24|13||||normal|||modulebody|  - Keep executable scripts focused on script-specific behavior|sgnd-exe-common.sh::::
sgnd-exe-common.sh|25|14||||normal|||modulebody|  - Centralize shared executable startup mechanics|sgnd-exe-common.sh::::
sgnd-exe-common.sh|26|15||||normal|||modulebody|  - Remain safe to source before the full framework is loaded|sgnd-exe-common.sh::::
sgnd-exe-common.sh|27|16||||normal|||modulebody|  - Allow executable scripts to override helpers when needed|sgnd-exe-common.sh::::
sgnd-exe-common.sh|28|17||||normal|||modulebody||sgnd-exe-common.sh::::
sgnd-exe-common.sh|29|18||||label|||modulebody|Role in framework|sgnd-exe-common.sh::::
sgnd-exe-common.sh|30|19||||normal|||modulebody|  - Executable runtime support layer|sgnd-exe-common.sh::::
sgnd-exe-common.sh|31|20||||normal|||modulebody|  - Loaded by executable templates after framework root resolution|sgnd-exe-common.sh::::
sgnd-exe-common.sh|32|21||||normal|||modulebody|  - Bridges executable startup and full framework bootstrap|sgnd-exe-common.sh::::
sgnd-exe-common.sh|33|22||||normal|||modulebody||sgnd-exe-common.sh::::
sgnd-exe-common.sh|34|23||||label|||modulebody|Non-goals|sgnd-exe-common.sh::::
sgnd-exe-common.sh|35|24||||normal|||modulebody|  - Framework root discovery|sgnd-exe-common.sh::::
sgnd-exe-common.sh|36|25||||normal|||modulebody|  - Application-specific behavior|sgnd-exe-common.sh::::
sgnd-exe-common.sh|37|26||||normal|||modulebody|  - Full UI rendering after ui-say.sh has loaded|sgnd-exe-common.sh::::
sgnd-exe-common.sh|38|27||||normal|||modulebody||sgnd-exe-common.sh::::
